<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta intensified cross-border airstrikes, bombing villages and a health centre near the Thai border and damaging Thai buildings opposite Mae Sam Laep, while warning Thai traders against supplying the KNU. ASEAN’s special envoy met Myanmar’s minister to discuss civil war aid access, and hours after the envoy left the junta bombed an IDP camp. Japan is lobbying to remove Myanmar from the global financial watchdog’s blacklist and the United States is seeking Myanmar’s rare earths, prompting accusations of undermining the EU diplomatic blockade. Thailand suspended unofficial border trade for seven days after artillery shells struck Thai homes in Tak province. 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNd25lb1d3STE5REUxUURpLVpxcnM0UUswYVhZT3MwbENIb1l1WUtRMmt0ZHRmaVg1LXpmbVE1RExQMUNmbUtvanZqNEpTczNTWDFIYUk0bW56bkJzNlFBVkNjYTBUNmVUV1kzczJVTk5kVWY4MVF2aFliZFlxeldWYXNVb1VBMnNJbE5Z?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPRVJZVmpwcFZkRWpxdl9yRGhiekJySTVrV1JqLUxpZlNpQ0swRzRNSHAzNTBmOVFkcmpzZ212SnVyckZHYmRoMEdaTXAxVEJtYlZiZ0I0OHNqWXZSU00wdS1uY1p2LTMtd1Z6UlExXzFNQU1jOENrN1p0VnhLSElWLWNFTGtscVZmdk0xMThnNFVKMER5bHc5aHNEUHJaTUlDcU9LTmZkSkwtZ21UQnA0azZkV1JOYzBzZ3F0ZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE1zLVJ3SElMUEZUeERNSkphN0xlU0U5WU9UZmpieDVVcWwyN3IxOUlLLXd6d29FUi1uM1ZnUjR6bjFrMnF3bnNqWG9CMnZvQVI4ckt4MmxQOEVBYzhfY1lua0xHLXZlUHZFR3o5WDk4VQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Narinjara News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQUjlCY2xMaUt6WDljblVrTlhYVkVQQ3Q2eHRQc1pZTkptM0pjR3lzcFFid21qN19HNHhpc1NGeVNRMWlOVU4